{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "45a502c1-e468-8166-b43f-497f366e8a89",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T15:17:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:14:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. My name is Wilson Monteiro. I'm calling about trash. There's a neighbor of mine who keeps dumping bags of trash at the corner by my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Monteiro. Dumping bags at the corner. Can you give me the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 455 Narragansett Avenue. The corner right there, where the side street meets it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "455 Narragansett Avenue. And the bags are sitting out on the corner, not at the curb in front of a house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, on the corner. Not in front of anybody's house. I saw him do it Sunday. I said to him, hey, that's not a pickup spot, and he said it's only a couple bags. And I said, well, a couple bags every week adds up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. So it's happened more than once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three, four times now. Anyway, how do I request a replacement? The last time somebody told me I need a new bin, because this one got cracked when the truck took it. She said to call Public Works and ask for one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two things. A replacement bin for your cracked one, and the bags at the corner. For the bin, I can put in a request for you right now. Is it the trash bin or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling. The blue one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blue recycling bin, cracked, at 455 Narragansett Avenue. I'll send that over to the crew that handles deliveries. And for the bags, I'll log a report so someone can go look at the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You know, my cousin used to have your job, years back. He told me the same thing, just call and they'll write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, he was right. Writing it down is what I'm doing. Can I get a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0188. Got it. And that's Wilson Monteiro, M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Replacement blue bin requested, and a report on the bags at the corner of Narragansett. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T15:17:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
